## ✅ Step 6 — How It Works

### Full Workflow
```
📧 Email Arrives
    ↓
📥 Detected in INBOX (every 30s)
    ↓
🔍 Extract Attachments
    • Filter by type (.pdf, .jpg, .png, .tiff)
    • Check size limit
    ↓
🤖 Submit to OCR Queue
    • Process in background
    • Live feed updates 🔴
    ↓
📤 Save Searchable PDF + Text
    ↓
🔔 Notify via:
    • Browser/Slack/Email ✅
    ↓
📂 Move Email → "Processed" Folder
    ↓
🧹 Cleanup Temp Files
```

### Folder Structure in Your Email
```
INBOX/
  └─ New emails → checked every 30s

Processed/          ✅ Success
  ├─ Invoice_123.pdf — processed
  └─ Contract.pdf — processed

Errors/             ❌ Failed
  └─ Corrupted_file.pdf — review manually
```

