## 🔒 Security Best Practices

- ✅ Use **App Passwords** — never your main password
- ✅ Create **dedicated email account** for OCR processing
- ✅ Enable **IMAP over SSL/TLS** (port 993) — never plain text
- ✅ Temp files **auto-deleted** after processing
- ✅ Credentials via `.env` — **never commit to repo**
- ✅ Processing stays **on your server** — no cloud exposure

