## 📊 Monitoring & Troubleshooting

```bash
# Check if email monitor is running
docker-compose logs pdf-ocr | grep "Email"

# Live activity feed → http://localhost shows email jobs 🔴

# Common issues
docker-compose logs pdf-ocr | tail -20
```

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| **Login failed** | Check IMAP host/port; Gmail needs App Password + 2FA |
| **No emails found** | Ensure `UNSEEN` search works; check folder permissions |
| **Attachments skipped** | Verify extension in `allowed_extensions`; check size limit |
| **Slow polling** | Increase `EMAIL_CHECK_INTERVAL` to reduce server load |
| **Emails not moving** | Grant IMAP write permission to the account |

